What do you mean?

00:46:20.720 --> 00:46:22.160
Do you remember Noah?

00:46:22.160 --> 00:46:24.760
Hey, there's a flood coming and he preached for 120 years.

00:46:24.760 --> 00:46:25.580
And what'd they say?

00:46:25.580 --> 00:46:26.420
They mocked him.

00:46:27.900 --> 00:46:30.760
Listen, this morning, as believers,

00:46:30.760 --> 00:46:32.800
our job is to preach the gospel,

00:46:33.720 --> 00:46:36.760
is to preach the gospel of the Lord Jesus Christ.

00:46:36.760 --> 00:46:40.880
This day is salvation come to this house.

00:46:40.880 --> 00:46:41.720
Let's pray.

00:46:41.720 --> 00:46:42.640
Father, we love you.

00:46:42.640 --> 00:46:43.800
We thank you for loving us.

