And God, I pray that you would help us to be responsive.

00:46:51.000 --> 00:46:53.760
Lord, that you'd help us to be doers of the word.

00:46:53.760 --> 00:46:56.240
God, if there's someone here this morning

00:46:56.240 --> 00:46:58.600
that's never trusted the Lord Jesus Christ

00:46:58.600 --> 00:47:00.320
as their personal savior,

00:47:00.320 --> 00:47:02.840
God, I pray that today they would come

00:47:02.840 --> 00:47:04.840
to this old fashioned altar in just a moment

00:47:04.840 --> 00:47:06.760
and allow us to take a Bible and show them

00:47:06.760 --> 00:47:10.860
how they could know for sure that heaven is their home.

00:47:11.700 --> 00:47:14.180
God, I pray that you would help those

00:47:14.180 --> 00:47:16.180
