00:47:18.740 --> 00:47:21.860
there was that personal decision on that particular day.

00:47:21.860 --> 00:47:23.260
Would you help each one, Lord,

00:47:23.260 --> 00:47:26.140
to have a boldness to go forth

00:47:26.140 --> 00:47:28.660
and to preach the gospel of the Lord Jesus Christ.

00:47:28.660 --> 00:47:32.660
Give us a burden, Lord, to share the gospel.

00:47:33.580 --> 00:47:37.300
I pray that, Lord, you would have your will and way.

00:47:37.300 --> 00:47:39.980
I pray that you would be glorified.

